{"ref":"BDB, מַהֵר²","hw":"מַהֵר²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַהֵר</span></big>  <strong>adv. quickly, speedily</strong> (strictly <strong>Pi.</strong> inf. abs.) always immediately after vb.; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:8\" href=\"/Exodus.32.8\">Ex 32:8</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.26\">Dt 4:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.4\">7:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.3\">9:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.12\">12</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.20\">28:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:5\" href=\"/Joshua.2.5\">Jos 2:5</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Judges 2:17\" href=\"/Judges.2.17\">Ju 2:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 2:23\" href=\"/Judges.2.23\">23</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.8\">Pr 25:8</a> (on <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:18\" href=\"/Psalms.69.18\">ψ 69:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 79:8\" href=\"/Psalms.79.8\">79:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:3\" href=\"/Psalms.102.3\">102:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 143:7\" href=\"/Psalms.143.7\">143:7</a>, where <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> precedes, v. supr. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, מָהַר²\" href=\"/BDB,_מָהַר²\", dir=\"rtl\">מָהַר</a>).","next":"BDB, מָהִיר","prev":"BDB, מַהֵר"}